# Lrytas.lt

> Lrytas.lt is a Lithuanian news portal, the website of „Lietuvos rytas“, a daily newspaper published since 1990. Newsroom in Vilnius (UAB „Lrytas“). News about Lithuania and the world around the clock, in Lithuanian, with an English section: politics, society, crime, business and personal finance, sport, world affairs, health, science and technology, culture, lifestyle, food, cars, nature and weather, plus opinion columns, photo galleries and video.

Articles are written and edited by the Lrytas newsroom and named contributors. Every article has a byline, the publication and last update time, its section and topics, and structured data (schema.org NewsArticle JSON-LD) with the same facts. Article addresses look like https://www.lrytas.lt/<section>/<subsection>/<yyyy>/<mm>/<dd>/news/<slug>-<id> (no trailing slash, no query string); please cite and link that address. Contact the newsroom at news@lrytas.lt.

